      "commit": {
        "sha": "1ca79d4b4577f4359b200bffee9dd904f4d20f6d",
        "subject": "Revert signal re-raise exit relay; keep 128+signal exit codes",
        "body": "The namespace init reports the worker's death via exit code, so the\nouter process cannot distinguish a worker killed by signal N from a\nworker that called exit(128+N) — decoding and re-raising turns\nordinary exit codes like 137 into spurious signal deaths (with a core\ndump of the wrong binary) and hangs on exit 147 (SIGSTOP). The layer\nabove already normalizes real signal deaths to 128+N, so the relay\nalso had no observable benefit. Restore verbatim exit-code relay.",
        "author": "dylan-conway",
        "email": "dylanc@anthropic.com",
        "login": "dylan-conway",
        "prNumbers": []
      },
      "additions": 28,
      "deletions": 49,
      "fileCount": 3
    },
